{% comment %}
  Are the "spend more, save more" tiers switched on right now? Echoes 1 when they are, nothing when not.
  Theme settings → Zenith · Cart → Show the % off tiers: Off / Always / Only while a promotion runs.
  Read by zenith-cart-tier-pct, zenith-cart-offers and zenith-cart-summary, so they cannot disagree.
  Usage:
    {%- capture tiers_on -%}{%- render 'zenith-cart-tiers-on' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- if tiers_on != blank -%}…{%- endif -%}
{% endcomment %}
{%- liquid
  case settings.cart_tiers_show
    when 'always'
      echo 1
    when 'promo'
      capture zcto_promo
        render 'zenith-promo-on'
      endcapture
      if zcto_promo != blank
        echo 1
      endif
  endcase
-%}
